      "desc": "You open the copy of 'Cooking: A Modern Approach (3rd Ed.)' and start reading:\n\nRecipe #1\n---------\nGather all following ingredients and follow the directions to prepare this tasty meal.\n\nIngredients:\n  banana\n  chicken leg\n  cilantro\n  green hot pepper\n  yellow apple\n\nDirections:\n  roast the chicken leg\n  chop the cilantro\n  slice the green hot pepper\n  dice the yellow apple\n  fry the yellow apple\n  prepare meal\n",
      "room_type": "cook",
      "definite": null,
      "indefinite": null,
      "synonyms": [
        "recipe"
      ]
    },
